OL,3,GNEWSAEx-PC denies saving inappropriate
OL,4,Aimages to phone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former North Yorkshire police officer
OL,7,Fhas denied having saved inappropriate
OL,8,Fimages to his phone from a stag do
OL,9,FWhatsApp group.
OL,11,FA disciplinary panel was told that in
OL,12,F2018 Callum Storr became a member of
OL,13,Fthe Big Rose Stag Do group and
OL,14,Fdownloaded extreme pornographic videos
OL,15,Finvolving animals.
OL,17,FThe 30-year-old is also alleged to have
OL,18,Fabused his position by having an
OL,19,Finappropriate sexual relationship with
OL,20,Fa victim of domestic abuse, which he
OL,21,Falso denies.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
